        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Showbiz Tycoon\n- People: Run Run Shaw\n- Companies: Shaw Brothers Studio, TVB\n- Topics: Hong Kong television drama, entertainment, philanthropy\n\nFacts:\n- Run Run Shaw was born on November 23, 1907.\n- Showbiz Tycoon is a 2000 Hong Kong semi-biographical television drama.\n- Showbiz Tycoon is loosely based on the life of Run Run Shaw.\n- Run Run Shaw was also known as Shao Yifu and Siu Yat-fu.\n- Run Run Shaw was a Hong Kong entertainment mogul and philanthropist.\n- Run Run Shaw founded Shaw Brothers Studio and TVB.\n- Run Run Shaw died on 7 January 2014.",
